wine.inf: Register the native 64-bit common files directory (CommonW6432Dir).

Adobe's Unified Plugin Installer Agent (UPIA) reads CommonW6432Dir directly from the 64-bit
HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion key. Wine registers CommonFilesDir but not this alias, so UPIA
cannot build its UXP install path and rejects a Premiere UXP plugin with status -1 (seen with Mister Horse's
Animation Composer for Premiere 2.2.3 through Product Manager 3.7.7). Windows has the value (Microsoft's
CurrentVersion registry example shows it). Initialize it in the AMD64 and ARM64 sections from the existing
common-files directory id; an existing customized value is kept (flag 2, FLG_ADDREG_NOCLOBBER).

From le-birnes/LinDobe 0149, written by a LinDobe contributor in LinDobe PR #52 (LGPL-2.1-or-later; DCO sign-off on
the commit). Applies with patch -F0 on wine-11.10 with neutron-wine's own wine.inf.in hunks (unsecapp, widl winmd);
they are elsewhere in the file.

MEASURED on the shipped neutron-wine v11.10-187 runtime (Xvfb, fresh prefix, LinDobe's
tests/misterhorse/native-common-files.c, which compares CommonW6432Dir with CommonFilesDir in the 64-bit view):
  187 as shipped:                                  FAIL CommonW6432Dir: status 2 (value missing)
  187 with the two lines added to share/wine/wine.inf: PASS native common-files directory
The plugin install in Premiere was confirmed by the contributor under LinDobe (Wine 11.20), not under Neutron.

diff --git a/loader/wine.inf.in b/loader/wine.inf.in
--- a/loader/wine.inf.in
+++ b/loader/wine.inf.in
@@ -392,11 +392,13 @@
 HKLM,%CurrentVersionNT%\Winlogon,"Shell",,"explorer.exe"
 
 [CurrentVersionWow64.ntamd64]
+HKLM,%CurrentVersion%,"CommonW6432Dir",2,"%16427%"
 HKLM,%CurrentVersion%,"ProgramFilesDir (x86)",,"%16426%"
 HKLM,%CurrentVersion%,"CommonFilesDir (x86)",,"%16428%"
 HKLM,Software\Microsoft\Wow64\x86,,2,"wow64cpu.dll"
 
 [CurrentVersionWow64.ntarm64]
+HKLM,%CurrentVersion%,"CommonW6432Dir",2,"%16427%"
 HKLM,%CurrentVersion%,"ProgramFilesDir (x86)",,"%16426%"
 HKLM,%CurrentVersion%,"CommonFilesDir (x86)",,"%16428%"
 HKLM,%CurrentVersion%,"ProgramFilesDir (Arm)",,"C:\Program Files (Arm)"
